WEBVTT

00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:16,540
are too many supplement capsules bad for a digestive tract. If so, can I can the contents

00:00:16,540 --> 00:00:23,900
be emptied into a juicer smoothie? I would agree that yes, too many supplement the capsules

00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:32,380
themselves can be irritating to some people's stomach. So the only ones you can't open and put in

00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:38,140
are ones that are a time-released supplement. Usually they'll say that at the bottom, it's a time-released

00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:46,780
diacid or time-released whatever. Those ones you really shouldn't open up, okay? But anything else that's

00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:52,540
if it's not time-released and it's not a gel, you know, then if it's a powder in the capsule,

00:00:52,540 --> 00:00:59,180
by all means you can open it up. I think that's a great idea to open it up and put it in a smoothie. Yes.

